    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/d8dd3d3aad9153db7409b5fefc313d84.poster.webp?t=1750871773\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/d8dd3d3aad9153db7409b5fefc313d84.webp?t=1750871773\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=204 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Welcome to University</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college experience you'll never forget. Unless someone makes sure you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic life of a new university student navigating lust, secrets, and power plays at one of the most twisted institutions you\u2019ve ever enrolled in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/b8e9d14b9f5702752bd3884cdcfed93c.avif?t=1750871773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not just here to study.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to survive emotionally charged roommates, manipulative teachers, seductive strangers, and a growing conspiracy led by someone only known as X \u2014 a puppet master who seems to know everything about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the term progresses, you'll make choices that shape your relationships \u2014 and determine who you can trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because at this university, everyone is watching\u2026 and some of them want to own you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/2d0c8714916bc10efb83e13d7d3a4dca.poster.webp?t=1750871773\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/2d0c8714916bc10efb83e13d7d3a4dca.webp?t=1750871773\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=167 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf51 Explicit Adult Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich, fully illustrated NSFW scenes that blend tension, humor, and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/fe859f3e0807f97f1772e12ec2ce1b70.poster.webp?t=1750871773\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/fe859f3e0807f97f1772e12ec2ce1b70.webp?t=1750871773\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=221 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Unfolding Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden puppet master is pulling the strings. As secrets unravel, the line between fantasy and danger begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Cinematic Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 5000+ renders and 100+ animations deliver a high-quality, immersive experience from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Extensive Image Gallery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your favorite moments, poses, and scenes with over 100 unlockable images in the gallery system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/257d4bf45c55b0bc83360de30f052839.avif?t=1750871773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Bonus Scenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 12 bonus scenes available as DLC - optional content beyond the main storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Multi-Layered Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own motivations, secrets, and desires. Peel back the layers\u2026 or get lost in them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/a4268085ab1175bd365c1207d3096aed.poster.webp?t=1750871773\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564970/extras/a4268085ab1175bd365c1207d3096aed.webp?t=1750871773\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=167 /></picture></span></p>",
